Let’s see an example of this.

62
00:01:50.061 --> 00:01:51.905
You can open a terminal and type print('I

63
00:01:52.386 --> 00:01:55.392
love Python!') to see how it works.

64
00:01:55.392 --> 00:01:57.681
Now that you can print messages, the next

65
00:01:57.741 --> 00:01:59.448
step is to learn about variables.

66
